Hōʻike ka pōʻaiapili i luna i kou mau makemake a me kou ʻano i aʻo ʻia. E hoʻohana iā ia e alakaʻi i kāu mau pane. No ka ʻike hou aku, e kāhea iā crow_recall me kahi nīnau kikoʻī a me kahi register (style/bug/arch/context/life_pref/life_avoid/life_phil/life_context).
